    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend part U of chapter 55 of the laws of 2014, amending the real\nproperty tax law relating to the tax abatement and exemption for rent\nregulated and rent controlled property occupied by senior citizens, in\nrelation to the effectiveness thereof; and to amend chapter 129 of the laws of\n2014, amending the real property tax law relating to the tax abatement and\nexemption for rent regulated and rent controlled property occupied by persons\nwith disabilities, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9418",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9418-2023",
